  "content": "<h2>Presentation</h2>\n<oer-google-slides slides=\"2PACX-1vTKsgVUmLzY3WAx5o0e8ZipbwBfFSUzgYUBUccvInt9PjubvpIbqTR9QEJS6Yq6XfF5E7419MfNEAJn\" title=\"Introduction to Animation\"></oer-google-slides>\n<h2>Topics Covered</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Screenings</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Hk6SXggQ_QQ\">Fairytales of motion by Alan Warburton</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://vimeo.com/93206523\">Illusion of Life</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://vimeo.com/159043081\">Newton’s 3 laws of motion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CtRBOI0PVgI\">Animation Mentor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JBgG_VSP7f8\">Karl Sims - Evolved Virtual Creatures, Evolution Simulation, 1994</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://vimeo.com/6736261\">Berlin Tetris</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://cloud.blender.org/p/spring/\">Spring</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Short Animation Examples</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://vimeo.com/155262093\">Forms in Nature: Understanding Our Universe</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/PmPwU5ytgVw\">Childhood (Adult Swim) by David O’Reilly</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://vimeo.com/100592289\">Walk Cycles by David O’Reilly</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://vimeo.com/17411241\">30 motion tests in 30 seconds</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://vimeo.com/141974554\">Bloom</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://vimeo.com/143914234\">FITC presents FORM // Chicago 2015 Titles</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://vimeo.com/217314168\">Squares 2017 Digital Invitation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://vimeo.com/150824660\">geist.xyz</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://vimeo.com/150594088\">Simple Shapes in Motion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://vimeo.com/39792837\">Spherikal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://vimeo.com/130886893\">30 Seconds / Edition One / Tomas Garcia</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Terminology</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eadweard_Muybridge\">Eadweard Muybridge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://animeight.com/2018/02/21/3d-production-pipeline/\">3D Animation Pipeline</a></li>\n<li>12 Principles of animation</li>\n<li>Newton’s Laws of Motion</li>\n<li>Graph Editor</li>\n<li>Keyframe</li>\n<li>Timeline</li>\n<li>FPS</li>\n<li>Dope Sheet</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Books</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Animators-Survival-Kit-Principles-Classical/dp/086547897X\">Animators Survival Kit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Illusion-Life-Disney-Animation/dp/0786860707/\">Illusion of Life</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n"
